 r←GetReleaseList(data caption)
⍝ Returns the list of releases for the side column of a package page, as a vector of character
⍝ vectors.
⍝ `data` holds one row per release, newest first: [;1] package ID, [;2] publishing date.
⍝ `caption` says what the count refers to, like "in major version 0".
⍝ Every release is in the HTML. "package-page.js" shows only the newest of them at first,
⍝ together with a button that shows the rest; without JavaScript they are all simply there.
 r←⊂'<section class="releases">'
 r,←⊂'<div class="section-head"><h3>Releases</h3><span>',(⍕≢data),' ',caption,'</span></div>'
 r,←⊂'<ol class="release-list" id="release-list">'
 r,←GetReleaseList_¨↓data
 r,←⊂'</ol>'
 r,←⊂'</section>'
⍝Done
